# Documentation directories

- **`docs/`** is reserved for GitHub / project docs. Do not put agent specs, plans, or process docs there.
- Write design specs to `cursor-docs/superpowers/specs/`.
- Write implementation plans to `cursor-docs/superpowers/plans/`.
- `cursor-docs/` is local-only — keep it gitignored; do not commit it.
- This overrides Superpowers defaults that mention `docs/superpowers/`.
